<p>There's a pile shattered ancient Roman cameo in the basement of Site-17 where time stops dead, and the only people who can fix it are in lockup in a world where they don't exist. But if they don't exist, how did someone know they were coming? Something has gone terribly pear-shaped.</p>
<p>Image is in the Public Domain, and can be found <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Stanley_R._Mickelsen_Safeguard_Complex#/media/File:Perimeter_acquisition_radar_building,_phase_shifter_service_platform;_level_three_-_Stanley_R._Mickelsen_Safeguard_Complex,_Perimeter_Acquisition_Radar_Building,_Limited_Access_Area,_HAER_ND-9-P-36.tif" target="_blank">here</a>.</p>
<p>Special Thanks are in order to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/malycegraves" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4916887); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4916887&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1579272146" alt="MalyceGraves" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4916887)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/malycegraves" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4916887); return false;">MalyceGraves</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/soullesssingularity" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(637830); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=637830&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1579272146" alt="SoullessSingularity" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=637830)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/soullesssingularity" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(637830); return false;">SoullessSingularity</a></span> for their invaluable criticism and guidance during the drafting process. Without them, this would be a much weaker piece than it is today.</p>
<p>I forgot how bloody hard this was.</p>
<p>Edit: Don't forget to check for antimemetic redaction&#8230; y'know&#8230; just in case.<br />
Edit2: In the event that this doesn't win, I'd like slot SCP-5087, plz. :3</p>

