			<div class="content" id="post-content-4766818">
									

<p>So, the ConProcs and Description were interesting to me and kept me reading. Then came the first 2 collapsibles and I was ready to upvote, but then 5087-INT came in like a freight train and I couldn't stop myself from upvoting before Dr Xyank was even done with his part. The remainder secured my vote and the last note after the collapsibles was icing on the cake for me.</p>
<p>I feel Temporal Anomalies technology and theory fits as sufficiently advanced technology as to be indistinguishable from magic (paraphrasing Clarke). Antimemetics Division falls in the same bucket for me and I love them both!</p>
<p>Writing like this helped me get back on track after a TBI and it continues to help me stretch my mind. Keep it coming, I can't wait to see more!</p>

